<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal"><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial">Our
upcoming blood drive is <span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">&lt;date/time&gt;</span>
at <span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">&lt;location&gt;</span>
and we need you to be a part of this lifesaving event<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;
mso-bidi-font-family:Arial">Did you know?<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp;
</span></span>In the U.S., it is estimated that approximately 100,000 people
have sickle cell disease — most who are of African descent and will require
regular blood transfusions to help manage their disease. <o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal">I am so pleased to share that the Red Cross expanded its
testing to include sickle cell trait screening on all donations from
self-identified African American, Black, and multiracial donors. This screening
will help the Red Cross identify compatible blood types more quickly to help
sickle cell patients and provide an additional health insight for donors.<o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><b>Here’s how you can help: <o:p></o:p></b></p>

<ul style="margin-top:0in" type="disc">
 <li class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst" style="margin-left:0in;mso-add-space:auto;
     line-height:105%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1">Sign up to donate at <a href="https://www.redcrossblood.org">RedCrossClood.org</a> using sponsor
     code <b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:
     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;background:yellow;mso-highlight:
     yellow">&lt;code&gt;</span></b><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;
     mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold">, or via the Red
     Cross </span><a href="https://www.redcrossblood.org/blood-donor-app.html"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:
     Arial;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold">Blood Donor App</span></a><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:
     Arial;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold">, or by replying to me. </span><o:p></o:p></li>
 <li class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="margin-left:0in;mso-add-space:
     auto;line-height:105%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:
     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold">Complete
     your </span><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;
     mso-bidi-font-family:Arial">health questionnaire via<span style="mso-bidi-font-weight:bold"> </span></span><a href="https://www.redcrossblood.org/donate-blood/manage-my-donations/rapidpass.html">RapidPass</a>®
     <span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:
     Arial">and save time on the day of the blood drive.</span><o:p></o:p></li>
 <li class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="margin-left:0in;mso-add-space:
     auto;line-height:105%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1">Review the Sickle Cell
     Trait Screening <a href="https://www.redcrossblood.org/faq.html#donating-blood-sickle-cell-trait-screen">FAQs</a>
     and visit <a href="https://www.redcrossblood.org/donate-blood/blood-types/diversity/african-american-blood-donors/sickle-cell-trait-screening.html">RedCrossBlood.org/SCTrait</a>
     to learn more.<o:p></o:p></li>
 <li class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast" style="margin-left:0in;mso-add-space:auto;
     line-height:105%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1">Spread the word and bring
     friends, family and colleagues to donate.<o:p></o:p></li>
</ul>

<p class="MsoNormal">Together, we can create a way of positive change and ensure
that everyone in need, has access to a diverse and sufficient blood supply. If
you have any questions, please contact me, a Red Cross representative at
1-800-RED CROSS, or visit <a href="https://www.redcrossblood.org">RedCrossBlood.org</a>.<o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;
mso-bidi-font-family:Arial">Sincerely,<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;
background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">&lt;Name&gt;</span><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial"><o:p></o:p></span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
